-  "uiSettingsTab.guide.features.item3": "Wide bubbles: the user message bubble grows from its 525px cap to about 80% width (pairs best with the wide conversation);",
-  "uiSettingsTab.guide.features.item4": "Context warning: the context ring turns yellow above 30% and red above 40% \u2014 a nudge to bookmark or start a fresh session;",
