-  "panel.config.perTurnWriteGuard": "Memory write watchdog",
-  "panel.config.perTurnWriteGuard.hint": "Off (default): the root cause is model instruction-following \u2014 strong models do not need it. On: after consecutive turns without a daily/project write, the snapshot pins a catch-up warning (clears once written)",
